# Trapeze reads the BrowserPod API key server-side via its Cloudflare Pages
# Function at functions/api/bp-key.js, which returns env.BP_APIKEY to the
# client. On Cloudflare, set BP_APIKEY as a Pages project environment variable
# (not VITE_-prefixed, so it stays out of the client bundle).
#
# For local `wrangler pages dev`, put it in a .dev.vars file as BP_APIKEY=...
BP_APIKEY=
